---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
---
<Site
  title="Pricing - FlutterProbe"
  description="FlutterProbe pricing. The CLI, agent and local tools are free. Team and Scale are planned and by invitation; there is no checkout yet. Design partners are being invited."
  path="/pricing/"
>
  <div class="page-header">
    <h1>Pricing</h1>
    <p>The CLI and the agent are free to use. Probe Cloud, hosted test history for your team, is a design-partner preview: Team and Scale are planned and by invitation, and nothing can be bought yet.</p>
  </div>

  <section class="partners" id="design-partners" aria-labelledby="dp-h">
    <h2 id="dp-h">Become a Probe Cloud design partner</h2>
    <p>We are looking for the first 10 Flutter teams to try Probe Cloud and tell us what is missing. This is the way in today.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Free during the beta</strong> for the first 10 teams.</li>
      <li><strong>50% off for life</strong> on any paid plan, applied when paid plans launch.</li>
      <li>In exchange: honest feedback, and a short call or written notes after you have used it on a real project.</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="cta">
      <a class="btn-p" href="https://github.com/AlphaWaveSystems/flutter-probe/issues/new?template=design-partner.yml">Apply as a design partner</a>
      <a class="btn-s" href="mailto:support@alphawavesystems.com">Apply by email</a>
    </div>
    <p>The GitHub form is a public issue: say only what you are happy to have public, or write to us by email instead. The beta may change or end, and plan details are not final. The CLI, agent and local tools stay free. See <a href="/probe-cloud/">what the preview does today</a>, or <a href="/demo/">a sample dashboard</a> (made-up data from a fixture app). We use your details only to contact you about the program: <a href="/terms/">terms</a>, <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a>.</p>
  </section>

  <div class="wide">
    <div class="plans">
      <div class="plan">
        <span class="pill live">Available now</span>
        <h3>Free</h3>
        <div class="price">$0</div>
        <p class="desc">For individual developers, open-source projects and any team that runs its own tests. Free to use for any purpose, including production, except offering a competing hosted testing service (BSL 1.1 for the CLI, MIT for the agent).</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Full CLI and Dart agent</li>
          <li>Unlimited local test runs</li>
          <li>All ProbeScript features</li>
          <li>Terminal, JUnit and JSON reports</li>
          <li>probe-convert (all 7 formats)</li>
          <li>VS Code extension</li>
          <li>Recording and visual regression</li>
          <li>Unlimited seats</li>
          <li>1,000 results a month in Probe Cloud (preview)</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="cta"><a class="btn-p" href="/getting-started/installation/">Install free</a></div>
      </div>

      <div class="plan planned">
        <span class="pill planned">Planned, by invitation</span>
        <h3>Team</h3>
        <div class="price">$49 <small>/ month</small></div>
        <p class="desc">Planned price, not final. Not available yet, and there is no checkout: the plan opens by invitation. Free for design partners during the beta.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Everything in Free</li>
          <li>Unlimited seats, no overage</li>
          <li>100,000 results a month</li>
          <li>Run history for your team</li>
          <li>Flaky tests flagged, with the evidence</li>
          <li>A verdict for each commit</li>
          <li>Trends over time</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="cta"><a class="btn-s" href="#design-partners">See the design-partner offer</a></div>
      </div>

      <div class="plan planned">
        <span class="pill planned">Planned, by invitation</span>
        <h3>Scale</h3>
        <div class="price">$149 <small>/ month</small></div>
        <p class="desc">Planned price, not final. Not available yet, and there is no checkout: the plan opens by invitation.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Everything in Team</li>
          <li>Unlimited seats, no overage</li>
          <li>500,000 results a month</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="cta"><a class="btn-s" href="#design-partners">See the design-partner offer</a></div>
      </div>

      <div class="plan planned">
        <span class="pill planned">Planned</span>
        <h3>On-The-Go (pay what you use)</h3>
        <div class="price">Price to be announced</div>
        <p class="desc">The pay-as-you-go way to use Probe Cloud, in addition to the plans. Billed separately from the plan, price to be announced. It is not available yet and cannot be bought.</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Part of Probe Cloud, not of the free CLI</li>
          <li>Billed by use, separately from Free, Team and Scale</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="cta"><a class="btn-s" href="/probe-cloud/">About Probe Cloud</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="note">Results are the test results a team uploads to Probe Cloud in a month. Local runs are never counted and never limited. Prices are in US dollars and are planned prices, not offers: nothing here can be bought today. Plans, prices and allowances can change before they open. See the <a href="/terms/">terms</a>, <a href="/privacy/">privacy notice</a> and <a href="/refunds/">refund and cancellation policy</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Site>
